      "conclusion": "stable-public-peer",
      "reviewer": "Codex primary implementer",
      "decision": "At line 24 in legacy-slide-toggle/internal/slide-toggle-required-validator.ts, checker-bound CheckboxRequiredValidator alias CheckboxRequiredValidator has role empty-historical-public-subclass. The historical class remains an empty extension of genuine public CheckboxRequiredValidator. Public Validator and OnChanges contracts drive the observed normalization, required-true validation and callback behavior; private implementation fields/helpers are not adopted. Genuine original/minimum complete namespaces and consumed declarations inspected. Sixteen meaningful source/runtime mutations and strict minimum public-interface fixtures pass. Readonly token typing, empty-Set validation and required field-initializer changes are explicit limits; no universal validator equivalence. Native node/CVA/input inheritance/full forms/components/application/root, packed/AOT/floors and upstream SHA/security remain separate. Product API, HTML, CSS, SCSS and consumers unchanged.",
